  "rationale": "Collectively the columns give genuine analytical leverage for the travel-policy-risk query: is_travel scopes the population, policy_risks directly enumerates risk types, and amount_tier supports magnitude-based grouping. Grounding is generally sound for is_travel and amount_tier, but policy_risks introduces specific travel qualifiers (International/Premium Travel) that are not clearly supported by the available source text, lowering the table-level groundedness."
